From f151f7b08bcf3f3616c8a647c962720a9111c407 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: coop-fw <coop-fw@localhost>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 22:41:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] --audio-dump: SPORT output to a WAV; --audio in headless;
 traces see MMR writes

WavAudioOutput writes the SPORT transmit frames (what the codec plays) as a
16-bit stereo 44.1 kHz WAV instead of a sound device, in headless and
deterministic runs too, and logs the format and the nonzero frame count.
--audio opens the real device in a headless run. Write traces now also see the
MMR fast path in Emulator::WriteAttended, so DMA register writes can be traced.
